		(descr "Gateron KS-20 / Magnetic Jade (Hall-effect, MX-compatible) switch, 1u, plate mounted, origin at the switch centre. No electrical pins and no centre post: only the two plastic pegs. The magnet sits in the stem, straight above the origin, where the Hall sensor goes (on the back of the eTuttino PCB).")
